<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lāmentābĭlis</span></b> ,
			e, adj.
		lamentor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>mournful, lamentable</i> (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Full of sorrow, expressing sorrow</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">afflictus et jacens, et lamentabili voce
					deplorans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 2, 13, 32</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 5, 3, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Causing sorrow, deplorable</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">funera sumptuosa et lamentabilia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 2, 25, 64</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regnum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg. A.
					2, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tributum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 263</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
